	(text "I2C BUS (shared with MAX17048 on power_bms; pull-ups R37/R38 2.2k on connectivity):\n  MAX17048  0x36  fixed       (19-6171 Rev 7, \"Slave Address\": 0110110b)\n  LIS3MDL   0x1C  SA1 = GND   (DocID024204 Rev 4 sec 5.1.1; 0x1E with SA1 high)\n  LIS2DH    0x19  SA0 = VddIO (Doc ID 022516 Rev 1 sec 5.1.1; 0x18 with SA0 low)\nNo collisions in either strap position. Both CS pins tied to Vdd_IO = I2C mode, as both\ndatasheets require (LIS3MDL sec 5.1 \"CS line must be tied high\"; LIS2DH sec 3).\nREWORK: R407-R410 isolate each sensor from SCL/SDA; R412-R415 re-strap addresses;\nR411 is the sensor-rail current break (TP121 on +3V3_SNS).\nINT/DRDY outputs are push-pull by default (no pull-ups placed); both sensors run\nVdd = Vdd_IO = 3.3V (LIS3MDL Vdd 1.9-3.6V, LIS2DH 1.71-3.6V, Vdd_IO <= Vdd+0.1V,\nTable 5 of each datasheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "19a11961-11df-4c4a-aa4a-dcf521c80e7c")
	)
	(text "Address straps (fitted / DNP alternate)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 149.86 0)
		(effects
