	)
	(text "VERIFIED vs NOT. Verified from the real PDFs (pdftotext -raw and -layout): pinouts\n(LIS3MDL Table 2, LIS2DH Table 2 -- both match the KiCad stock symbols), I2C\naddresses, CS/SDO strapping rules, C1 = 100nF, decoupling values, supply ranges.\nLIS2DH copy read: Doc ID 022516 Rev 1 (Nov 2011) via a distributor mirror -- ST's\nsite refused the download. NOT verified: LIS2DH current lifecycle status\n(one distributor lists it as no longer manufactured -- check before ordering),\nand the exact capacitor MPNs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "614d53e8-9e20-4b1d-a900-953d5b48270c")
	)
