		(property "Description" "ST LIS3MDL 3-axis magnetometer: the station HEADING. I2C 7-bit address 0x1C (SDO/SA1 strapped to GND via R412; fit R413/remove R412 for 0x1E) -- DocID024204 Rev 4 sec 5.1.1. CS tied to Vdd_IO for I2C mode (sec 5.1). C1 pin 4 = 100nF (C400), Vdd 100nF + 1uF (C35, C401), sec 4.1 / Figure 5. Siting: keep >10mA currents a few mm away (sec 4.3) -- see sheet keep-out note."
