		(property "Description" "ST LIS2DH 3-axis accelerometer: tilt compensation for U10 + knock/move detect on INT1. I2C 7-bit address 0x19 (SDO/SA0 strapped to Vdd_IO via R414; fit R415/remove R414 for 0x18) -- Doc ID 022516 Rev 1 sec 5.1.1 / Table 14. CS tied high for I2C (sec 3). Pins 10-14 Res = connect to GND (Table 2). Decoupling 100nF + 10uF at pin 8 (sec 3). LIFECYCLE NOT CONFIRMED: a distributor lists LIS2DH as no longer manufactured; check ST before ordering (LIS2DH12 is a different, LGA-12 part)."
